⍝ trith/lib/json.c: a document is text, read and changed by path
⎔ $trith_json_get$ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ◌ʃ⟩ ‹jget› ⸫
⎔ $trith_json_type$ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹jtype› ⸫
⎔ $trith_json_len$ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹jlen› ⸫
⎔ $trith_json_at$ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌ʃ⟩ ‹jat› ⸫
⎔ $trith_json_key$ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ℤ ⊸ ◌ʃ⟩ ‹jkey› ⸫
⎔ $trith_json_bool$ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸ ℤ⟩ ‹jbool› ⸫
⎔ $trith_json_set$ ⟨ʃ ʃ ʃ ⊸ ◌ʃ⟩ ‹jset› ⸫
⎔ $trith_json_quote$ ⟨ʃ ⊸ ʃ⟩ ‹jquote› ⸫

⍝ ‹show› doc path: print the value at path, or (none)
⦃ ‹jget› ⁇ ⦃ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $(none)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ $\n$ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ʃ ⊸⟩ ‹show› ⸫

⍝ ‹active› doc i: print the name of user i if that user is active
⦃
  ⧖:i
  $users$ ⧗:i ‹jat› ⁇
    ⦃ ⟗ $active$ ‹jbool› △ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⟗ $name$ ‹show› ⦄ ∅ ⁼ ⌁̵ ⦄
    ⦃ ⦄
⦄ ⟨⟗ʃ ℤ ⊸⟩ ‹active› ⸫

⦃
  ${"database": {"host": "localhost", "port": 5432}, "features": {"newFeature": false}, "users": [{"name": "Alice", "active": true}, {"name": "Bob", "active": false}, {"name": "Cara", "active": true}], "motto": "café \"ok\""}$
  ⟗ $database.host$ ‹show›
  ⟗ $database.port$ ‹show›
  ⟗ $motto$ ‹show›
  ⟗ $users.1.name$ ‹show›
  ⟗ $users.7.name$ ‹show›
  ⟗ $database$ △ ‹jkey› ⁇ ⦃ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $(none)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $users: $ ⎙̵ ⟗ $users$ ‹jlen› ⎙ $type of the document: $ ⎙̵ ⟗ $$ ‹jtype› ⎙
  ⍝ the active users, by index
  ⟗ $users$ ‹jlen› ○
  ⥀ ⦃
    ⧖:n,i
    ⟗ ⧗:i ‹active›
    ⧗:n ⧗:i △ ⊞ ⍿¹ ⍿¹ ≶ ⋔ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄ ⦃ ⊕ ⦄ ⦃ ⦶ ⦄
  ⦄
  ⌁ ⌁
  $features.newFeature$ $true$ ‹jset› ⁇ ⦃ ⎙̵ ⦄ ⦃ $(no document)$ ⎙̵ ⦄ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $say "hi"\n$ ‹jquote› ⎙̵ $\n$ ⎙̵
  $type of [1, 2: $ ⎙̵ $[1, 2$ ⟗ $$ ‹jtype› ⎙ ⌁̵
⦄ ⟨⊸⟩ ᛟ ⸫
